  "data": {
    "summary": "[SUSTAINED HITS 1] counts only when this attack targets a unit with neither MONSTER nor VEHICLE. If even one model in the target unit has either keyword, the whole unit counts as having it, so the ability does nothing. Otherwise each critical hit scores 1 extra hit on the target, so that attack hits it twice in total.",
